Aether: base product

Branding, prefs, update channel, about pages: the Aether product shell.

Squashed from 1 units:

  [core/01-product.patch]
  Aether: base product (branding, flags, URLs, prefs, NTP, about)
  
  Groups phases: 00, 10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60, 70, 75, 80, 81.
